WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
- Gentlemen, we WILL remain the face of the game.

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:07.833
- But we must do everything we can

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:09.083
to stop them.

00:00:09.666 --> 00:00:11.708
Leave no stone unturned.

00:00:12.833 --> 00:00:15.041
Before they become

00:00:15.041 --> 00:00:16.708
too powerful.

